# Railway → Web service (Node) Variables
#
# Omit PORT on Web service (app listens on 7000 on Railway to match Networking → target port 7000).
#
# Reference MySQL plugin: MYSQL_URL (or MYSQLHOST, MYSQLPORT, MYSQLUSER, MYSQLPASSWORD, MYSQLDATABASE).
# Required: JWT_SECRET, ALLOWED_ORIGINS (your Firebase site URLs, comma-separated).
# First admin when users table is empty: INITIAL_ADMIN_USER, INITIAL_ADMIN_PASS (remove pass after login).
# Optional: AUTH_ALLOW_REGISTER=true, SMTP_* + CONTACT_NOTIFY_EMAIL, SKIP_DB_MIGRATIONS=true
